    "Steam 客户端内没有密钥入口。请在浏览器登录 Steam 官方密钥页面，查看或申请密钥，再复制到下方。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API keys are not available in the Steam client. Sign in to Steam’s official API key page in your browser, view or register a key, then paste it below."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 客户端内没有密钥入口。请在浏览器登录 Steam 官方密钥页面，查看或申请密钥，再复制到下方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam 尚未完成同步": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam hasn’t finished syncing"
