    "Steam 没有返回游戏。请检查个人资料的“游戏详情”隐私设置；改为公开会让其他人也能查看相关游戏信息": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam returned no games. Check the “Game details” privacy setting on your profile. Making it public also lets other people see your game information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam 没有返回游戏。请检查个人资料的“游戏详情”隐私设置；改为公开会让其他人也能查看相关游戏信息"
          }
        }
      }
